<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Summarize-Exemplify-Reflect: Data-driven Insight Distillation Empowers LLMs for Few-shot Tabular Classification</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
