<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 1: </span>Overall performance for few-shot tabular classification. We use 16/32/64/128 samples for training and 16 shots for in-context demonstration. The averaged F1 scores (%) are reported, <em id="S3.T1.6" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">i.e.,</em> each number (except for the Avg column) is averaged from <math id="S3.T1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="5\times 4=20" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">5\times 4=20</annotation></semantics></math> tests. The best and second-best results are <span id="S3.T1.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">bolded</span> and <span id="S3.T1.8" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">underlined</span>. * indicates the best performance among all methods using the same base LLM. Detailed results see Appendix <a href="#A3.SS1" title="C.1 Detailed Overall Performance Results ‣ Appendix C Extra Experimental Results ‣ Summarize-Exemplify-Reflect: Data-driven Insight Distillation Empowers LLMs for Few-shot Tabular Classification" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">C.1</span></a> and <a href="#A3.SS2" title="C.2 Performance Under Full Training Data ‣ Appendix C Extra Experimental Results ‣ Summarize-Exemplify-Reflect: Data-driven Insight Distillation Empowers LLMs for Few-shot Tabular Classification" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">C.2</span></a>.</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="S3.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">3.3 </span>Algorithm</h3>

<figure id="alg1" class="ltx_float ltx_float_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="alg1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 1</span> </span> InsightTab </figcaption>
<div id="alg1.4" class="ltx_listing ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="alg1.l0" class="ltx_listingline">
