             classification task <math id="alg1.l0.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>T</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T</annotation></semantics></math>, training data <math id="alg1.l0.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{D}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{D}</annotation></semantics></math>, test sample <math id="alg1.l0.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tilde{x}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mover accent="true"><mi>x</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tilde{x}</annotation></semantics></math>, number <math id="alg1.l0.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n_{e}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n_{e}</annotation></semantics></math>/<math id="alg1.l0.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n_{h}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n_{h}</annotation></semantics></math> of easy/hard samples, <math id="alg1.l0.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\texttt{LLM}_{s}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace">LLM</mtext><mi>s</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\texttt{LLM}_{s}</annotation></semantics></math> for rule summarization, <math id="alg1.l0.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\texttt{LLM}_{p}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace">LLM</mtext><mi>p</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\texttt{LLM}_{p}</annotation></semantics></math> for prediction

