<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 5: </span>Overall F1 performance on the public tabular datasets with different number of training samples <math id="A2.T5.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>n</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n</annotation></semantics></math>. For each LLM-based model, we report the performance based on mistral-7b/gpt-3.5-turbo using 16 shots. The best and second-best results are <span id="A2.T5.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">bolded</span> and <span id="A2.T5.6" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">underlined</span>. </figcaption>
</figure>
